{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_15523","headline":"天柱隐所重荅江州应物 · 畅当","name":"天柱隐所重荅江州应物","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"寂寞一怅望，秋风山景清。\n此中惟草色，翻意见人行。\n荒径饶松子，深萝绝鸟声。\n阳崖全带日，宽嶂偶通耕。\n拙昧难容世，贫寒别有情。\n烦君琼玖赠，幽懒百无成。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"畅当","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_15523.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_15523","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}